(2) Inteko rusange ishobora gushyiraho
izindi nzego bitewe n’ibyo ikeneye.

(a) kugira inama Leta ku bijyanye
n’ibikenewe mu kubaka ubushobozi
mu rwego runaka;
(b) gukora igenamigambi mu kubaka
ubushobozi no kuyihuza na gahunda
y’Igihugu yo kongera ubushobozi;
(c) gukora ubushakashatsi hagamijwe
kumenya ubushobozi bukenewe ku
isoko ry’umurimo;
(d) gutanga inama ku mirimo ikeneye
ubumenyi bwihariye no ku igenzura
ry’isoko ry’umurimo kugira ngo
bifashe mu gutanga impushya zo
gukora;
(e) gushyiraho no gukurikirana ibipimo
by’ubushobozi busabwa ku cyiciro
cy’umurimo runaka;
(f) gukorana n’abafatanyabikorwa mu
gutegura amasomo n’imfashanyigisho
bifasha gutanga ubushobozi bwihariye
ku rwego rw’urwego runaka;
(g) guteza imbere uburyo bwo kwigira ku
murimo;
(h) gutanga ubufasha mu ingenzura
ry’ubuziranenge n’itangwa
ry’impushya ku batanga amahugurwa;
(i) kumenyekanisha amakuru ku mwuga
no kuyobora abashaka akazi;
(j) kugira uruhare mu itangwa
ry’amasomo no kugenzura imyigire;
(k) guhuza ibikorwa by’amahugurwa mu
rwego runaka;
(l) gukurikirana imikorere y’abatanga
amahugurwa.
